# Pi-hole Deployment

## Objective

Deploy Pi-hole as a containerized DNS service on the Fedora homelab.

## Deployment

Pi-hole was deployed using Docker Compose.

The deployment included configuration for:

- DNS
- Web administration
- Container networking
- Persistent configuration
- Host port mappings

## Validation

The deployment was validated by checking:

```bash
docker ps
docker logs <pihole-container>
